      ],
      "description": "<p>HitDefのtypeパラメータを数字で返します。<br>: 0 - non, 1 - high, 2 - low, 3 - trip (地上ヒット時のみ)</p>",
      "visibility": "internal"
    },
    {
      "parameter": "animtype",
      "type": [
        "int"
      ],
      "description": "<p>HitDefのanimtypeパラメータを数字で返します。<br>(0 - light, 1 - medium, 2 - hard, 3 - back, 4 - up, 5 - diag-up)</p>",
      "visibility": "internal"
